    {
      "number": 26,
      "name": "大畜",
      "symbol": "䷙",
      "upper": "艮",
      "lower": "乾",
      "source_name": "大畜",
      "guaci": {
        "classical_text": "利貞。不家食吉。利涉大川。",
        "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_026-2a"
      },
      "tuan": {
        "classical_text": "《大畜》，剛健篤實，煇光日新。其德剛上而尚賢，能止健，大正也，「不家食吉」、養賢也，「利涉大川」、應乎天也。",
        "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_026-3a"
      },
      "xiang": {
        "classical_text": "天在山中，《大畜》。君子以多識前言往行以畜其德。",
        "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_026-4a",
        "note": null
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "marker": "初九",
          "classical_text": "有厲，利己。",
          "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_026-5a",
          "xiaoxiang": {
            "classical_text": "「有厲利己」、不犯災也。",
            "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_026-6a",
            "status": "MAPPED"
          },
          "line": 1
        },
        {
          "marker": "九二",
          "classical_text": "輿說輹。",
          "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_026-7a",
          "xiaoxiang": {
            "classical_text": "「輿說輹」、中无尤也。",
            "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_026-8a",
            "status": "MAPPED"
          },
          "line": 2
        },
        {
          "marker": "九三",
          "classical_text": "良馬逐，利艱貞，曰閑輿衛，利有攸往。",
          "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_026-9a",
          "xiaoxiang": {
            "classical_text": "「利有攸往」、上合志也。",
            "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_026-10a",
            "status": "MAPPED"
          },
          "line": 3
        },
        {
          "marker": "六四",
          "classical_text": "童牛之牿，元吉。",
          "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_026-11a",
          "xiaoxiang": {
            "classical_text": "「六四元吉」、有喜也。",
            "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_026-12a",
            "status": "MAPPED"
          },
          "line": 4
        },
        {
          "marker": "六五",
          "classical_text": "豶豕之牙，吉。",
          "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_026-13a",
          "xiaoxiang": {
            "classical_text": "「六五」之「吉」、有慶也。",
            "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_026-14a",
            "status": "MAPPED"
          },
          "line": 5
        },
        {
          "marker": "上九",
          "classical_text": "何天之衢，亨。",
          "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_026-15a",
          "xiaoxiang": {
            "classical_text": "「何天之衢」、道大行也。",
            "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_026-16a",
            "status": "MAPPED"
          },
          "line": 6
        }
      ],
      "use_line": null,
      "raw_classical_transcription": "《大畜》利貞。不家食吉。利涉大川。《彖》曰：《大畜》，剛健篤實，煇光日新。其德剛上而尚賢，能止健，大正也，「不家食吉」、養賢也，「利涉大川」、應乎天也。《象》曰：天在山中，《大畜》。君子以多識前言往行以畜其德。初九：有厲，利己。《象》曰：「有厲利己」、不犯災也。九二：輿說輹。《象》曰：「輿說輹」、中无尤也。九三：良馬逐，利艱貞，曰閑輿衛，利有攸往。《象》曰：「利有攸往」、上合志也。六四：童牛之牿，元吉。《象》曰：「六四元吉」、有喜也。六五：豶豕之牙，吉。《象》曰：「六五」之「吉」、有慶也。上九：何天之衢，亨。《象》曰：「何天之衢」、道大行也。",
